WEBVTT

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:05.550
Seriously, you should just 
commute to school from here

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:07.450
instead of entering 
some dumb dormitory.

00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:09.880
Honestly! That isn't an option.

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:11.600
I will be attending a strict

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:14.110
all-girls' school that 
doesn't allow men on campus.

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:16.430
I can't let them learn of this place!

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:18.780
Because it's the allegedly 
haunted residence

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:20.490
of the Four Houses of 
the Sacred Beasts?

00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:22.320
Kaname, you just don't get it.

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.010
A girl's curiosity is a fearsome thing.

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:26.000
Yeah?

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:29.730
Hamaji, why do you 
want to attend school?

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:30.500
Whoa!

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:33.510
Because I can't become one if I don't.

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:35.610
Become what?

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:39.040
A doctor!

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:13.440
I've heard that Stashed 
Village was hit by an

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:15.620
unprecedented amount of 
heavy rain the other day.

00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:19.170
Although they were able 
to save the rain water,

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:20.850
Guard

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:22.980
the sudden downpour caused main 
level and basement flooding,

00:02:22.980 --> 00:02:24.310
damaging the homes.

00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:26.350
Some of the houses,

00:02:26.350 --> 00:02:29.710
fields and community roads 
were completely submerged.

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:32.620
Are you the god of misfortune?

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:35.240
Damn those demons!

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:36.380
And?

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:38.380
Did you find what you 
were searching for?

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:40.160
Not even a clue!

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:45.470
Would be an exaggeration.

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:49.170
But I didn't get there in time, 
so nothing made any sense.

00:02:49.490 --> 00:02:51.400
Yatsufusa, put him down.

00:02:56.580 --> 00:02:58.730
Hamaji requested that 
I make some muffins.

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:00.110
Would you like one?

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:01.530
Are you sure?

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:04.470
N-no, we could never step 
out of line like that...

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:05.050
Right?

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:06.190
Y-yeah.

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:08.880
I have blueberry, walnut 
and cheese muffins.

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:10.800
Okay, I'll take a walnut muffin!

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:11.660
Blueberry!

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:12.760
Cheese!

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:13.060
Yay! What a day!

00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:14.720
Hmm, I can't decide. Yay! What a day!

00:03:17.310 --> 00:03:18.390
Delicious!

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:19.900
This is good!

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:20.810
This blueberry muffin is heavenly.

00:03:20.810 --> 00:03:21.650
Sosuke! This blueberry 
muffin is heavenly.

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:23.610
Oh, Hamaji!

00:03:24.020 --> 00:03:26.830
I did as you asked and 
baked some muffins.

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:30.060
Thanks. The girls in the 
dorm will love them.

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:32.560
What are you doing?!

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:35.770
Why don't you wait until 
Shino can see you off?

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:39.420
I imagine Mr. Satomi should be 
done chastising him shortly.

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:41.070
I can't wait that long.

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:45.570
Actually, there is something 
I would like to ask of Shino.

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:49.580
I ordered some specialty books that 
should be arriving this afternoon.

00:03:50.110 --> 00:03:52.710
Please ask him to drop them off 
at my dorm once they're here.

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:56.210
But aren't men prohibited 
at this all-girls' school?

00:03:56.470 --> 00:03:57.740
Not a problem.

00:03:57.740 --> 00:03:59.530
Shino could pass as my younger sister.

00:04:03.940 --> 00:04:06.720
So she wants me to drop 
this off at her dorm?

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:09.010
You won't get to see her for a while

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:10.730
once she begins dorm life, you see.

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:12.850
She isn't allowed to leave campus.

00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:15.230
I don't mind dropping this off,

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:17.240
but it's pitch dark.

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:20.230
Mr. Satomi certainly gave you an earful.

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:22.870
Do you think she wants to 
read these books right away

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:24.740
since she special ordered them?

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:27.130
HOW TO DIFFERENTIATE POISONOUS MUSHROOMS
 Supervisor: Romanian Witch Association

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:27.130
How to Differentiate 
Poisonous Mushrooms.

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:29.830
Herbology Handbook
 LEARN THROUGH USE: HERBS

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:29.830
Learn Through Use: Herbs.

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:32.250
How to Poison...

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:32.250
How to Poison

00:04:32.890 --> 00:04:34.520
Let's get these to her right away!

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:35.590
Right this instant!

00:04:35.590 --> 00:04:37.310
Before anyone sees them!

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:39.250
Good idea.

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:45.240
This the place? It's huge!

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:48.160
I'll wait out here.

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:51.350
Be sure not to let anyone see you.

00:04:51.650 --> 00:04:52.270
'Kay!

00:04:57.660 --> 00:05:00.260
I've never seen a school 
this freakin' big before.

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:03.350
It's kinda creepy.

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:06.800
Maybe it's because 
everyone here is a girl.

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:09.790
Hamaji... should be okay here.

00:05:15.850 --> 00:05:17.440
What a quiet room...

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:21.290
And here I had Sosuke bake some muffins.

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:25.180
Well, I suppose I could just 
hand them out in class tomorrow.

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:27.730
What's this?

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:32.190
Oh, right!

00:05:32.190 --> 00:05:35.310
I'm sorry! I totally forgot that 
a new student was moving in today.

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:36.560
Are you my roommate?

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:40.060
Yup! I'm Suzu Kumagai. Nice to meet ya!

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:42.770
I'm Hamaji. It's a pleasure.

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:44.570
What kept you out so late?

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:47.380
I was just a wee bit 
late for class today.

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:49.910
They've been chewing 
me out this whole time.

00:05:50.130 --> 00:05:51.550
I'm starving...!

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:53.580
Oh, um, I have some muffins.

00:05:53.840 --> 00:05:54.750
Want one?

00:05:54.930 --> 00:05:56.080
Muffins?!

00:05:58.300 --> 00:06:00.380
With Hamaji gone,

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:02.840
it is as though this mansion's 
fire of life has burnt out.

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:07.230
And here is the corpse of a man 
who has lost the fire of life.

00:06:08.940 --> 00:06:09.850
I'm bored.

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:14.470
Speaking of Hamaji, why did she 
suddenly decide to attend school?

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:16.280
She already possesses enough intellect

00:06:16.280 --> 00:06:18.770
and education to marry 
into the Osaki house.

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:21.980
She even treated us with due respect!

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:23.610
What an admirable young lady!

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:27.490
But see, she wants to 
become something someday.

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:29.990
What would that be?

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:33.120
Hamaji said that she 
wants to become a doctor.

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:36.250
She'll become a doctor so 
there won't be any problems

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:38.600
if her friend's body reverts 
to its sickly state.

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:42.730
That way he won't have 
to suffer ever again.

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:45.040
Isn't Hamaji amazing?

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:49.200
It made me feel extremely 
ashamed of myself.

00:06:49.980 --> 00:06:52.380
I'm not the one who made them,

00:06:52.380 --> 00:06:54.010
but you're welcome to have more.

00:06:56.110 --> 00:06:57.520
They're so good!

00:06:57.920 --> 00:07:01.780
Thank you! I've been alone in 
this room ever since I came here.

00:07:02.140 --> 00:07:03.470
I'm so glad you're my roomie.

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:05.150
Really?

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:08.540
To be honest, I was a 
bit nervous coming in.

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:11.380
This is my first time 
staying in a dormitory.

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:13.240
I heard that you have strict rules

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:16.000
and that everyone comes 
from respected families...

00:07:18.020 --> 00:07:19.400
But I'm glad...

00:07:20.430 --> 00:07:25.220
I'm really happy that you're 
my roommate, Kumagai.

00:07:27.100 --> 00:07:29.800
Gawd! Hamaji, you're so cute!

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:31.800
With me around, you'll be just fine.

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:34.800
Please call me Suzu.

00:07:34.900 --> 00:07:37.920
Don't worry. We can have loads of fun.

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:39.260
R-really?

00:07:39.260 --> 00:07:41.580
It's true that the school is strict,

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:44.810
but they'll let most things slide 
unless the prefect catches you.

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:46.430
The prefect?

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:50.190
Ruri Kobayakawa, the prefect.

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:52.660
She's the super rich heiress 
to a vertical monopoly.

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:54.940
With looks and smarts, 
she's pretty popular.

00:07:54.940 --> 00:07:57.340
But she's really strict.

00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:01.750
Murasame!

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:04.460
What is that? A crow?

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:06.460
What brought you here at this hour?

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:09.690
Hamaji, we brought something deadly!

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:11.260
It's, uh...

00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:13.840
Books on how to kill?

00:08:15.520 --> 00:08:17.360
And? Where is Shino?

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:19.100
B-backyard.

00:08:20.150 --> 00:08:21.180
I'll be right back.

00:08:22.280 --> 00:08:25.600
Wait, Hamaji! What about 
the crow? The crow!

00:08:26.410 --> 00:08:27.080
Shino!

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:31.240
Why're you wearing that, Hamaji?

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:32.990
You took forever to get here, Shino!

00:08:33.170 --> 00:08:35.020
Here ya go. I brought 
the stuff you requested.

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:37.490
Do you have any idea what time it is?

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:39.880
That jerk Satomi wouldn't shut up...

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:41.830
You only have yourself to blame.

00:08:42.590 --> 00:08:43.500
Where is Sosuke?

00:08:43.840 --> 00:08:45.170
Waitin' outside.

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:49.040
He refuses to come in since 
this is off-limits to dudes.

00:08:49.390 --> 00:08:50.660
Talk about straight-laced.

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:53.190
And what does that make you,

00:08:53.190 --> 00:08:56.130
waltzing in at this hour 
when you know the rules?

00:08:59.570 --> 00:09:02.140
But I wouldn't change a 
thing about you, Shino.

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:05.000
Be sure to come when I 
call, just like today.

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:05.950
You're gonna call for me?

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:07.740
Got a problem with that?

00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:08.480
N-no!

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:12.540
Be careful on your way back.

00:09:14.010 --> 00:09:17.090
Try not to cause too 
much trouble for Satomi.

00:09:17.090 --> 00:09:18.750
I don't put him out!

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:20.030
I think...

00:09:23.630 --> 00:09:32.300
<i>Hanbunko, hanbunko. Omae to aitsu de hanbunko
Half and half. Each of you gets half</i>

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:37.840
<i>Chiisana karada wo hanbunko
 Each gets half of your tiny body</i>

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:44.030
<i>Naka yoku, naka yoku hanbun zutsu
 Harmoniously, harmoniously you each share half</i>

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:50.180
No!

00:09:50.180 --> 00:09:51.070
Shino!

00:09:53.210 --> 00:09:56.070
Hey, Shino! You okay?

00:09:56.420 --> 00:09:59.320
C'mon! Have some breakfast and perk up.

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:01.360
I'm sorry, Kobungo.

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:02.640
I didn't mean to barge in on you.

00:10:02.640 --> 00:10:04.300
Don't worry 'bout it.

00:10:04.300 --> 00:10:08.220
Although I'll admit it was freaky  
when a dog burst in with a kid

00:10:08.220 --> 00:10:10.330
on its back in the middle of the night.

00:10:10.560 --> 00:10:12.290
Even though he was unconscious,

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:13.840
it doesn't look like he's hurt anywhere.

00:10:14.180 --> 00:10:15.610
What the heck happened?

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:19.340
I can't say. I'm really not sure.

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:23.480
He was going to see our friend who 
is boarding at an all-girls' school.

00:10:24.150 --> 00:10:25.840
But he fell unconscious 
in the school grounds...

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:27.810
It didn't look like he was up to

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:29.350
offering a detailed 
account of what happened.

00:10:30.490 --> 00:10:33.160
Hmm, an all-girls' school, huh?

00:10:34.120 --> 00:10:37.860
I bet you ran into a 
girl ghost, didn't ya?

00:10:41.550 --> 00:10:43.870
What is this? Did he tell a funny story?

00:10:41.590 --> 00:10:42.560
That's lame!

00:10:45.420 --> 00:10:48.560
I saw... a ghost doll.

00:10:49.470 --> 00:10:51.630
A ghost doll?

00:10:51.720 --> 00:10:53.130
What's with that?

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:55.750
I mean, don't you have to 
be dead to become a ghost?

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:59.880
But a doll is never dead 
or alive to begin with.

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:03.980
But I saw it! It had fluffy fur!

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:05.250
That makes it even harder to picture.

00:11:05.740 --> 00:11:11.260
So I was wondering, Shino, why're you 
freakin' out over a measly ghost?

00:11:11.740 --> 00:11:14.790
I mean, you're totally 
cool with monsters.

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:16.900
Don't tell me...

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:19.900
Ghosts are the only thing 
that seriously terrifies you?

00:11:20.080 --> 00:11:23.210
B-but they're already dead!

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:26.080
"Creepy" is the only word to describe

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:27.910
how they hang around even in death.

00:11:28.300 --> 00:11:30.540
Th-they're so...

00:11:31.510 --> 00:11:33.600
He just admitted that they scare him.

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:34.930
He most certainly did.

00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:37.480
For the record, cockroaches 
are Shino's worst enemy.

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:39.140
He's such a delicate maiden.

00:11:39.140 --> 00:11:41.430
So what was this ghost like?

00:11:41.560 --> 00:11:43.480
I know! Shino, draw it.

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:46.020
Like I said, it...

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:49.810
It had fluffy fur and there was 
somethin' white on its head.

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:52.810
It had a bag strapped across it...

00:11:53.240 --> 00:11:55.510
And it was wearin' 
somethin' like a bell.

00:11:57.360 --> 00:11:58.070
This is it!

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:00.170
Isn't it terrifying?

00:12:02.670 --> 00:12:05.250
Oh, what's up? Why is 
everyone huddled together?

00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:08.720
That's cute.

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:11.880
Shino, did you want a stuffed animal?

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:17.430
You're laughing too hard, Asakeno.

00:12:18.310 --> 00:12:19.410
Is that it, Shino?

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:20.820
Would you like me to buy 
you a stuffed animal?

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:21.920
No, thank you!

00:12:30.860 --> 00:12:32.270
Are you still fuming?

00:12:32.740 --> 00:12:33.630
Not really.

00:12:34.240 --> 00:12:37.900
It is not as though I question 
the validity of your story.

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:40.890
You should take a look.

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:44.340
There are remnants of its aura,

00:12:44.750 --> 00:12:46.190
along with the faint sound of a bell.

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:49.480
Various things are intermingling.

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:52.350
Not surprising around a 
group of young ladies.

00:12:52.840 --> 00:12:55.600
It's such that even a sensitive 
child could just barely perceive it.

00:12:56.810 --> 00:12:59.230
I wonder who gave it an actual form.

00:13:07.990 --> 00:13:11.200
I swear, this place truly is massive.

00:13:11.780 --> 00:13:14.570
It's a pity that I'm not 
in the same class as Suzu.

00:13:15.030 --> 00:13:17.370
But I should be able to 
keep up in my classes.

00:13:17.870 --> 00:13:19.260
I suppose everything 
is going to work out.

00:13:19.700 --> 00:13:21.390
I wonder what the library is like.

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:23.190
Hamaji?

00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:29.400
You must be the new student 
who just arrived yesterday.

00:13:29.710 --> 00:13:31.420
Oh, isn't she...?

00:13:31.770 --> 00:13:34.460
Are you Ruri Kobayakawa, the prefect?

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:37.120
My, you already know about me?

00:13:37.450 --> 00:13:39.960
I apologize for not 
introducing myself sooner.

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:45.720
That aside, Hamaji, I saw you leave 
the dormitory late last night.

00:13:46.940 --> 00:13:48.250
That is in violation of school rules.

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:50.320
I-I'm sorry!

00:13:50.320 --> 00:13:52.100
My younger sister came to see me.

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:54.750
She was dropping off some 
stuff I left at home.

00:13:55.950 --> 00:13:57.720
Really? Very well, then.

00:13:58.340 --> 00:14:02.250
It was your first day; I'll 
let it slide just this once.

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:04.590
But watch yourself.

00:14:06.630 --> 00:14:08.530
This facility has a "guard".

00:14:09.300 --> 00:14:11.830
No one has ever seen the guard,

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:15.290
but the first time she catches 
you will be your last.

00:14:15.890 --> 00:14:17.860
She is fierce with her punishments.

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:21.060
Try to be careful.

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:25.940
Hey, Suzu? Have you 
heard of the "guard"?

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:27.260
The guard?

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:30.630
Oh, do you mean that "ring, ring" sound?

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:32.510
You've heard it?

00:14:32.820 --> 00:14:35.510
Yeah, when I snuck out one night.

00:14:35.510 --> 00:14:38.030
I heard it while I was munching 
on the peaches in the backyard.

00:14:38.030 --> 00:14:41.410
Then the dorm mom found me and 
I got into serious trouble!

00:14:41.410 --> 00:14:42.900
R-really?

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:45.760
But I've never actually seen the guard.

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:49.270
Everyone else is too scared 
to even talk about her.

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:54.540
But... this sounds kind of fun.

00:14:57.890 --> 00:14:59.720
Hamaji, you're one tough cookie!

00:14:59.720 --> 00:15:00.790
Really?

00:15:01.430 --> 00:15:03.540
I'm not going!

00:15:03.680 --> 00:15:06.520
Why not? Doesn't this sound like fun?

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:08.920
They have a stuffed animal ghost!

00:15:09.150 --> 00:15:11.070
Why do you have to drag me along?!

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:13.930
If you're all that curious, 
you can go by yourself.

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:17.860
Are you sure you should be saying that?

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:23.440
Isn't your friend there, living 
in that haunted school?

00:15:23.950 --> 00:15:25.610
She must be so nervous!

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:29.170
Having just moved in, she is all by 
herself, without a single friend.

00:15:29.630 --> 00:15:30.450
See?

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:34.210
Doesn't that make you 
want to look into this?

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:36.800
Sosuke!

00:15:36.800 --> 00:15:42.710
Yeah, but still... I doubt 
it would pose a threat...

00:15:43.310 --> 00:15:46.460
Even so, I am worried about Hamaji.

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:48.290
That settles it!

00:15:53.980 --> 00:15:56.970
I don't sense anything 
particularly unique.

00:15:57.280 --> 00:15:59.570
It is simply big and spacious...

00:16:00.370 --> 00:16:01.880
So can we go?

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:04.240
Let's go! Let's go home!

00:16:04.990 --> 00:16:07.750
But there might be something 
amusing further in.

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:09.420
Did you just call this "amusing"?!

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:21.480
<i>Hanbunko, hanbunko. Omae to aitsu de hanbunko
 Half and half. Each of you gets half</i>

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:27.480
<i>Chiisana karada wo hanbunko
 Each gets half of your tiny body</i>

00:16:28.180 --> 00:16:34.480
<i>Naka yoku, naka yoku hanbun zutsu
 Harmoniously, harmoniously you each share half</i>

00:16:38.480 --> 00:16:42.660
Eh? Uh, is it a rabbit? Or a bear?

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:45.480
Sorry, but I'm a rabbear!

00:16:45.740 --> 00:16:47.160
It talked!

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:48.910
And what the heck is a "rabbear"?

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:51.490
It looks just like the picture you drew.

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:54.360
Well, jeez.

00:16:54.520 --> 00:16:57.000
I guess you could call 
this "amusing," but...

00:16:54.560 --> 00:16:57.670
<i>Anata no naka ni kanojo wa hitotsu
 She is one inside of you</i>

00:16:57.670 --> 00:17:02.900
<i>Koto, koto ugoku daiji na kanojo 
The precious lady moves with a thump, thump</i>

00:17:03.340 --> 00:17:09.180
<i>Tarinai anata ni kanojo ga kureta
 She gave it to you who were lacking</i>

00:17:09.390 --> 00:17:17.890
<i>Soshite kanojo wa modorenai
 And now she cannot go back</i>

00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:21.530
What was that for?!

00:17:21.530 --> 00:17:24.320
Nothing. I was just getting 
royally pissed at that critter.

00:17:24.320 --> 00:17:25.270
Not my problem!

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:27.760
Rulebook Clause 5, Article I:

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:30.270
No pets are allowed on school grounds.

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:33.850
I shall punish you for violating 
the aforementioned rule.

00:17:38.590 --> 00:17:40.090
What are you doing, you punk?!

00:17:40.210 --> 00:17:41.450
Now, now, Shino.

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:44.280
She made a perfectly reasonable point.

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:47.130
We are the ones who owe her an apology.

00:17:48.570 --> 00:17:50.920
This is growing to be out-right absurd.

00:17:51.730 --> 00:17:52.420
I'm leaving.

00:17:52.730 --> 00:17:54.550
Keno! Wait, you jerk!

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:56.930
I will punish any who break the rules.

00:17:59.070 --> 00:18:01.140
You're the one who insisted on coming!

00:18:01.410 --> 00:18:02.510
Take responsibility for your actions!

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:05.530
How is this supposed to 
be my responsibility?

00:18:05.530 --> 00:18:07.370
What about your friend?

00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:09.010
Aren't you worried about her?

00:18:09.010 --> 00:18:10.600
Hamaji has nothing to do with this!

00:18:11.580 --> 00:18:13.610
Um, ex-excuse me.

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:18.550
It would seem that we were 
under a misunderstanding.

00:18:18.880 --> 00:18:20.910
I apologize for having 
inconvenienced you.

00:18:23.650 --> 00:18:26.180
It looks like you are 
protecting these grounds.

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:28.900
Now that we know our 
friend is in good hands,

00:18:28.900 --> 00:18:30.040
we can rest at ease.

00:18:31.020 --> 00:18:32.900
Please continue to look after her.

00:18:33.360 --> 00:18:38.740
<i>Hanbun, hanbun. Omae wa hanbun
 Half, half. You are half</i>

00:18:39.100 --> 00:18:45.070
<i>Inu to omae de hitotsu zutsu
 One for you and one for a dog</i>

00:18:45.070 --> 00:18:50.210
<i>Keredo omae wa hanbun dake
 However, there is only half of you</i>

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:56.440
<i>Omae no tamashii hanbun dake
 This is only half of your soul</i>

00:18:57.080 --> 00:19:04.100
<i>Mou hanbun doko e itta?
 Where did your other half go?</i>

00:19:08.300 --> 00:19:09.550
Hey, Hamaji!

00:19:09.550 --> 00:19:10.580
Yes?

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:13.500
Hamaji, your friends are 
pretty neat, aren't they?

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:15.590
You mean Sosuke and Shino?

00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:18.410
Did I ever tell Suzu about them?

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:21.230
You have old friends who 
care deeply for you.

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:23.860
I guess you don't need me around.

00:19:25.190 --> 00:19:27.350
How could you say that?

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:30.600
Suzu, you're my dear friend 
and the first one I made here!

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:35.610
I'm seriously tickled pink 
to hear you say that!

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:38.410
Shoot!

00:19:39.210 --> 00:19:40.920
I left something in the room.

00:19:40.920 --> 00:19:42.670
Hamaji, you can go on without me.

00:19:42.670 --> 00:19:43.370
Should I accompany you?

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:46.180
Don't worry about me! 
I'll catch up in a sec.

00:19:48.300 --> 00:19:49.870
Good morning, Hamaji.

00:19:50.860 --> 00:19:52.880
Good morning, Ruri.

00:19:53.570 --> 00:19:55.750
Would you care to join 
me for lunch today?

00:19:56.640 --> 00:20:01.520
Thank you, but I already told 
my roommate I'd eat with her.

00:20:01.520 --> 00:20:02.760
Could she join us?

00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:04.860
Your roommate?

00:20:05.360 --> 00:20:08.770
Hamaji, weren't you supposed 
to have a room to yourself?

00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:09.560
Huh?

00:20:10.110 --> 00:20:12.150
You came so suddenly...

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:17.100
Everyone was worried that you 
might be lonesome by yourself.

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:20.970
Y-you'll have to pardon me!

00:20:20.970 --> 00:20:22.180
I just realized that I forgot something.

00:20:22.180 --> 00:20:22.610
Really?

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:26.120
If you like, please 
join us on the terrace.

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:32.790
Umm... Did I go into the 
wrong room by mistake?

00:20:33.550 --> 00:20:36.040
No, that couldn't possibly be it.

00:20:36.260 --> 00:20:37.210
Then what about Suzu?

00:20:38.640 --> 00:20:40.600
Suzu? Are you here?

00:20:54.570 --> 00:20:55.520
Suzu?

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:05.620
Something about her resembled 
Shino, didn't it?

00:21:06.710 --> 00:21:12.100
<i>Tsuyokute, yasahii otomo-dachi
 A strong yet kind friend</i>

00:21:12.530 --> 00:21:19.700
Sabishigariya no anata no hoshii mono
 That is what you who are lonesome desire

00:21:21.260 --> 00:21:24.510
Shino, did you wish for anything?

00:21:25.040 --> 00:21:26.890
When I first went to the school?

00:21:27.360 --> 00:21:28.040
Right.

00:21:31.530 --> 00:21:33.230
No, not really...

00:21:34.280 --> 00:21:36.870
I just thought it would 
be nice if Hamaji could

00:21:36.870 --> 00:21:38.680
make some friends before too long.

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:41.170
So she wouldn't get lonesome?

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:42.290
Yeah...

00:21:42.830 --> 00:21:46.170
Well, the place has an 
awfully strict guard.

00:21:46.590 --> 00:21:48.370
I am sure that there is no 
need to worry about her.

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:52.040
Knowing Hamaji, she'll be just fine.

00:23:26.050 --> 00:23:41.060
A Lonely Figure

00:23:27.190 --> 00:23:30.500
Jeez! If I knew Keno was 
going, I woulda gone!

00:23:30.500 --> 00:23:31.340
We coulda made it a nighttime date.

00:23:31.340 --> 00:23:32.850
I never want to go back.

00:23:32.850 --> 00:23:33.620
And what's this about a date?

00:23:33.620 --> 00:23:35.230
I'll protect you, fair lady!

00:23:35.230 --> 00:23:35.890
"Lady"?

00:23:35.890 --> 00:23:38.360
And in the dark, my hand 
will just so happen to...

00:23:39.870 --> 00:23:41.060
Whatever.
